WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.067
This function combines several ideas at once.

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:09.532
Amount is required, rate has a default of eight percent, the docstring explains the purpose,

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:13.277
and return sends the calculated tax back to the caller.

00:00:13.277 --> 00:00:18.517
With an amount of two hundred fifty and the default rate, the result is twenty dollars.

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:23.470
Call the function again with a ten percent rate and compare the result.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:30.510
This pattern can be adapted to discounts, fees, commissions, and many other calculations.
